WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.550
Every unit gets its own mark.

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.120
Five layers. Sense, map, understand, plan, act.

3
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.080
It sees in depth. Every point gets a distance.

4
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.310
Step into its lane, and it replans around you.

5
00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.000
Get close, and it slows. Closer, and it waits.

6
00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:24.700
Unit 1024. Full film in the comments.

